  dialogList:
  - characterSide: 0
    dialog: Hi, Defender. I am Osiris, the God of Life. I summon you because Seth,
      the God of Storms, is attacking our village.
  - characterSide: 1
    dialog: "Haha! You and your Defender won\u2019t stop me. I will unleash the full
      power of the tornadoes!"
  - characterSide: 0
    dialog: "Move the Wind Cannon with A and D, and blow with the left click. Change
      the tornadoes\u2019 trajectory so they don\u2019t destroy the village!"
  description: Premier dialogue d'introduction. Osiris parle au joueur pour expliquer
    le contexte
